==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[back-bite]]
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|bakbiten|lang=enm}}, {{term|bacbiten|lang=enm}}, equivalent to {{compound|back|bite}}. Cognate with {{etyl|is|-}} {{term|bakbíta||to backbite, vilify|lang=is}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|backbites|backbiting|backbit|backbitten}}

# To make [[spiteful]] [[slanderous]] or [[defamatory]] [[statement]]s about someone.
# {{informal}} To attack from behind or when out of [[earshot]] with spiteful or defamatory remarks.
# To speak badly of an [[absent]] individual.

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:defame]]
====Derived terms====
* [[backbiter]]
* [[backbiting]]

